":"p","text":"For entrepreneurship:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com","Travel Operations/Sales","Travel Product Specialist","Business Development","Own Travel Business"]}]},{"heading":"Study abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Country","Useful master's areas"],"rows":[[{"text":"🇬🇧 UK"},{"text":"Tourism Management, International Tourism"}],[{"text":"🇦🇺 Australia"},{"text":"Tourism & Hospitality Management"}],[{"text":"🇨🇦 Canada"},{"text":"Tourism Management, Hospitality"}],[{"text":"🇳🇿 New Zealand"},{"text":"Tourism Management"}],[{"text":"🇸🇬 Singapore"},{"text":"Hospitality & Tourism, Business"}],[{"text":"🇦🇪 UAE"},{"text":"Tourism, Hospitality, Aviation Management"}],[{"text":"🇳🇱 Netherlands"},{"text":"Tourism Management, Sustainable Tourism"}],[{"text":"🇨🇭 Switzerland"},{"text":"Hospitality & Tourism Management"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For international careers, destination knowledge should be combined with relevant visa, employment, consumer-protection and travel-industry regulations."}]},{"heading":"Career progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Travel consulting route"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Com Travel & Tourism"},{"type":"h","text":"Travel Intern"},{"type":"h","text":"Travel Executive"},{"type":"h","text":"Travel Consultant"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Travel Consultant"},{"type":"h","text":"Travel Team Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Travel Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Head of Travel"},{"type":"h","text":"Travel Business Director"},{"type":"h","text":"Corporate travel route"},{"type":"h","text":"Travel Executive"},{"type":"flow","items":["Corporate Travel Consultant","Senior Corporate Travel Consultant","Corporate Travel Manager","Regional Travel Manager","Head of Corporate Travel"]},{"type":"h","text":"Luxury travel route"},{"type":"h","text":"Travel Consultant"},{"type":"flow","items":["Luxury Travel Specialist","Senior Luxury Travel Advisor","Luxury Travel Manager","Luxury Travel Director","Premium Travel Entrepreneur"]},{"type":"note","label":"Emerging specialisations","text":"2030–2040"},{"type":"h","text":"1. AI Travel Consulting"},{"type":"p","text":"AI will increasingly support:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Itinerary generation"},{"text":"Destination discovery"},{"text":"Hotel recommendations"},{"text":"Travel planning"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Personalisation"},{"text":"Price comparison"},{"text":"Travel support"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The consultant's value shifts toward judgement, trust, complex planning and problem resolution."},{"type":"h","text":"2. Corporate Travel Intelligence"},{"type":"p","text":"Corporate travel teams will increasingly analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Travel expenditure"},{"text":"Employee travel patterns"},{"text":"Supplier performance"},{"text":"Travel policy compliance"},{"text":"Cost optimisation"},{"text":"Traveller safety"},{"text":"Carbon emissions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Sustainable Travel"},{"type":"p","text":"Growing opportunities in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sustainable tourism"},{"text":"Eco-tourism"},{"text":"Responsible tourism"},{"text":"Carbon-aware travel"},{"text":"Community-based tourism"},{"text":"Sustainable destination management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Luxury Personalisation"},{"type":"p","text":"High-value travel increasingly requires:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Personalised experiences"},{"text":"Private tours"},{"text":"Premium accommodation"},{"text":"Concierge services"},{"text":"Special occasions"},{"text":"Exclusive destination experiences"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Travel Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Travel professionals will increasingly work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Booking engines"},{"text":"CRM"},{"text":"Dynamic pricing"},{"text":"Recommendation systems"},{"text":"Customer-data platforms"},{"text":"Travel analytics"}]},{"type":"note","label":"2040–2046","text":"How the Travel Consultant role evolves"},{